    <header class="hero">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">the open source AI workspace</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">Get your own enterprise agent.</h1>
      <p class="hero__subtitle">Open source, model agnostic, and connected to anything you use. Built for complex reports and long running tasks.</p>
      <p class="hero__target">For companies that want their own enterprise AI agent.</p>
      <div class="hero__cta-row">
        <button class="hero__cta hero__cta--primary" data-open-demo>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
